WEBVTT

00:05.040 --> 00:10.840
Alright, everyone turn to page 44
in your textbooks. Are we ready ?

00:11.400 --> 00:16.320
Mister Yokota,
sorry I'm late again...

00:24.280 --> 00:26.840
Katayama,
what's wrong with your back ?

00:28.800 --> 00:33.240
Yeah. It just started swelling
for some reason.

00:35.160 --> 00:36.880
And there we go...

00:42.920 --> 00:45.680
- What is that thing ?
- It looks like a snail shell !

00:46.200 --> 00:49.360
- That's so freaky...
- So gross...

00:52.800 --> 00:53.920
A spiral...

01:31.760 --> 01:33.080
Did you hear that ?

01:44.680 --> 01:48.040
Snakes ! Those snakes
are coiled around each other !

01:51.440 --> 01:54.960
Weird, that's so creepy.
They're fighting, aren't they ?

01:55.720 --> 01:58.480
Like our parents... They're
tearing out each other's throats.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.120
Not fighting...
They're mating.

02:17.840 --> 02:20.960
I heard that they still don't know
where Azami is.

02:21.880 --> 02:23.600
It must have been
rough for you, Kirie.

02:24.000 --> 02:26.040
You were questioned
by the police, weren't you ?

02:26.640 --> 02:28.800
- Yeah...
- Guess what ?

02:29.440 --> 02:31.880
Did you know they've started
burying people again ?

02:33.400 --> 02:35.120
They're doing burials now
instead of cremation.

02:35.200 --> 02:38.600
You know those spirals that have been
swirling above the crematorium lately ?

02:39.360 --> 02:40.360
Yeah.

02:49.080 --> 02:50.600
They're saying
it's a freak incident.

02:50.920 --> 02:54.440
A mixture of a furnace malfunction
and unique weather patterns.

02:54.640 --> 02:57.800
I hear there have been spirals above
crematoriums in other cities, too.

02:58.080 --> 03:01.920
But it's only when someone from
Kurouzu is cremated. Mind-blowing !

03:05.000 --> 03:07.840
They bury them now, to avoid having
cremation smoke turn into a spiral.

03:08.680 --> 03:11.840
But it's unreal knowing there are dead
bodies buried along our path to school.

03:12.640 --> 03:13.800
It gives me the creeps.

03:16.760 --> 03:17.760
Let's get going...

03:20.880 --> 03:22.080
Kirie ! I love you.

03:22.480 --> 03:24.600
Don't scare people like that,
Yamaguchi !

03:25.120 --> 03:26.240
Did I getcha ?

03:26.960 --> 03:30.600
Why are you wasting your time
anyway ? Kirie already has a boyfriend.

03:30.960 --> 03:32.600
Yeah, I know !
But, you see...

03:32.680 --> 03:35.000
I wanna score a pretty thing like you
as my girlfriend

03:35.120 --> 03:36.840
and shock the hell out of everyone.

03:37.080 --> 03:41.560
Gimme a break. This is why everyone
calls you Jack-in-the-Box, you weirdo !

03:43.480 --> 03:45.320
Scaring people is just what I do.

03:45.840 --> 03:48.000
I don't want anything to do
with your pranks or you.

03:48.200 --> 03:51.280
Please stop bothering me.
Let's go, Shiho.

03:52.440 --> 03:55.280
Kirie !
Fine, but I'm not gonna give up !

03:56.000 --> 03:58.600
Mark my words,
you're so gonna fall for me !

04:04.640 --> 04:07.240
- Stupid punk !
- We warned you to stay away from her.

04:09.320 --> 04:11.360
Come on, Yoriko !

04:11.760 --> 04:13.560
No ! Let go of me, Dad !

04:13.960 --> 04:15.040
Yoriko !

04:15.120 --> 04:16.160
Little brat !

04:16.480 --> 04:17.640
Kazunori !

04:17.800 --> 04:20.720
- Let's go !
- No ! Kazunori !

04:23.160 --> 04:24.320
Are you okay ?

04:27.000 --> 04:28.080
Kazunori...

04:34.080 --> 04:37.120
- They're so twisted...
- Who are ?

04:37.800 --> 04:41.760
Do you remember ? My family moved
here when I was in grade school.

04:42.400 --> 04:44.720
We settled into that old,
abandoned row house.

04:44.960 --> 04:47.080
The one that everyone calls
the "poor house".

04:47.400 --> 04:50.320
Yeah, Shuichi and I would go
over there sometimes.

04:50.720 --> 04:53.240
Yoriko's family are our neighbors
in the same property,

04:53.880 --> 04:57.480
but we all hate each other.
Like I said, they're so twisted.

05:00.120 --> 05:03.760
I think it's because they can't accept
the poverty they've been dealt.

05:04.240 --> 05:08.120
So, they twist into knots...
Their only shield from that reality.

05:08.840 --> 05:12.280
When two twisted people lock horns
they entangle

05:12.480 --> 05:15.840
and things spiral out of control.
It's impossible to break free.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.960
They're really that twisted ?

05:18.360 --> 05:21.360
But you're not twisted like that
at all, Kazunori.

05:21.880 --> 05:24.040
Thanks.
I appreciate that, Kirie.

05:24.920 --> 05:29.120
I like to think that Yoriko and I
haven't become twisted like them yet.

05:30.600 --> 05:33.960
We're actually planning
to run away together.

05:34.120 --> 05:36.360
- What ?
- By train, the day after tomorrow.

05:36.840 --> 05:39.760
- Promise me you won't tell anyone !
- I won't.

05:52.760 --> 05:56.160
I really hope Kazunori and Yoriko
can find a way to be happy.

05:56.440 --> 05:59.200
Yeah. It's no wonder that
their families hate each other.

05:59.640 --> 06:03.040
The curse of the spiral, I can sense it
hanging over that row house.

06:03.120 --> 06:04.320
What are you saying ?

06:04.400 --> 06:07.000
The spiral is making them twisted,
warping their souls...

06:07.760 --> 06:11.320
I could always be wrong but the curse
feels particularly strong there.

06:12.000 --> 06:16.640
Recently, this entire town has started
to be slowly infected by the spiral.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.360
Here, look.

06:20.560 --> 06:21.800
Once they're touched
by the spiral,

06:21.920 --> 06:24.960
which has the clear power to draw
everything straight into its center,

06:25.280 --> 06:28.560
they're then driven to attract
the attention of anyone and everyone.

06:30.440 --> 06:34.400
By the way, Kirie...
Looks like your hair's gotten longer.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.240
What ?

06:42.320 --> 06:45.680
Come to think of it, my hair
does seem longer all of a sudden.

06:52.320 --> 06:55.880
Hey, Kirie ?
What's going on with your hair ?

06:56.640 --> 06:57.760
What ?

07:03.240 --> 07:05.920
I have no idea
where all these curls came from...

07:06.240 --> 07:08.160
Why don't you try
putting them into braids ?

07:08.600 --> 07:11.760
- I can do it for you, if you want.
- Sure. Thank you, Kyoko.

07:12.440 --> 07:17.080
The structure of DNA is commonly
referred to as a double helix.

07:17.760 --> 07:22.000
Picture two parallel strands that
form a ladder that is then twisted.

07:22.880 --> 07:25.240
Each strand
has its own distinct backbone

07:25.440 --> 07:27.920
made of sugar-phosphate units...

07:28.040 --> 07:29.200
Come on !

07:30.000 --> 07:33.200
The bases pair inwards,
anchoring to the helix's center.

07:36.800 --> 07:39.400
- What the hell is that thing ?!
- That's so gross !

07:40.280 --> 07:42.600
- It's Katayama...
- That's impossible.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.680
- Seriously ?
- Are you joking ?!

07:45.280 --> 07:48.800
That's totally Katayama !
See ?! Look at his face !

07:57.240 --> 07:58.480
His eyes popped out !

08:14.760 --> 08:17.400
Cut it short, please.
Go ahead and lop it all off.

08:18.360 --> 08:21.680
- Are you sure ?
- Yeah, it's creepy, and I hate it.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.920
All right, short it is, then.

08:30.920 --> 08:33.240
You're a monster !

08:39.880 --> 08:42.560
What's wrong ?
Let's take her to the hospital !

08:43.960 --> 08:45.480
- No, sis !
- Kirie !

08:46.280 --> 08:48.760
- She needs a doctor !
- I can't breathe...

08:49.200 --> 08:51.640
Her hair's angry !
That's why it's strangling her !

08:51.800 --> 08:53.800
It's hurting her
'cause she tried to cut it !

08:53.880 --> 08:57.440
- It doesn't wanna go to the hospital !
- Stop that, you're being ridiculous !

08:57.680 --> 08:59.200
She's not strangling herself !

08:59.640 --> 09:02.240
Honey, Mitsuo might
actually have a point.

09:22.160 --> 09:23.880
What's wrong with all of you ?

09:31.920 --> 09:33.200
Kirie, how...

09:40.400 --> 09:42.560
You there !
What's going on with your hair ?

09:51.280 --> 09:52.440
Kirie...

09:53.000 --> 09:56.200
Just you wait, I'll attract
even more attention than you.

09:58.880 --> 10:02.120
You seriously won't believe
what Sluggo had for breakfast today !

10:02.400 --> 10:04.240
A buncha of weeds
from the chicken coop !

10:04.760 --> 10:06.000
Come on, "Sluggo" ?

10:06.240 --> 10:08.720
That's pretty harsh even for you,
Tsumura !

10:27.720 --> 10:28.840
I hate this...

10:32.440 --> 10:34.280
He hasn't been home
in a couple of days

10:34.360 --> 10:36.440
and you're telling me
he was here this whole time ?

10:43.800 --> 10:44.960
This is your son.

10:54.440 --> 10:56.680
Absurd !
How can you say that's our son ?

10:57.280 --> 11:00.040
What is this some kinda sick joke ?!
Come, we're leaving !

11:00.160 --> 11:01.280
Right !

11:07.160 --> 11:08.360
Poor Katayama...

11:32.440 --> 11:33.720
Wait for me !

11:50.280 --> 11:51.400
Shuichi...

11:54.280 --> 11:56.200
Kirie ! Here's a token of my love !

11:58.360 --> 12:00.560
I'm sorry,
but I can't accept this.

12:01.280 --> 12:03.400
Well, at least open it
and see what's inside.

12:04.080 --> 12:07.440
No, I'm already seeing someone.
You need to stop this.

12:08.040 --> 12:11.760
What can I possibly do to make you
feel my true love for you ?

12:13.160 --> 12:15.320
I know !
Watch this, Kirie !

12:16.600 --> 12:18.960
I'll stop that car
with the power of my love !

12:19.280 --> 12:20.440
Yamaguchi !

12:30.240 --> 12:31.320
I love you...

12:39.680 --> 12:42.120
I heard Jack-in-the-Box
got killed by a car !

12:42.200 --> 12:43.720
Yeah, can you believe it ?

12:43.880 --> 12:46.360
Heard his body wrapped around
the front wheel, crushed to a pulp.

12:47.840 --> 12:48.960
No ! Not again !

12:50.000 --> 12:52.200
Man !
Katayama got out of his pen !

12:53.240 --> 12:54.320
Wait a sec...

12:54.640 --> 12:56.720
No way ! That's... Tsumura !

13:12.240 --> 13:13.320
Hey, Kirie !

13:21.680 --> 13:25.000
So, what do you think ?
Am I little more noticeable now ?

13:26.240 --> 13:28.880
I won't be second.
I'm better.

13:35.360 --> 13:37.680
Come on,
let's see what you've got, Kirie !

13:39.960 --> 13:44.280
Kyoko, please... I'm really not
interested in competing against you.

13:47.880 --> 13:50.880
Only one of us
can be the center of attention !

13:54.000 --> 13:56.160
Just looking at you
makes me feel so sick !

14:11.800 --> 14:12.920
Kirie !

14:17.440 --> 14:19.680
Kirie !
Hang on, I'll cut it off !

14:37.200 --> 14:40.120
Now I'm really
the center of attention around here !

14:59.360 --> 15:02.920
Look at me !
Get a good look at me, everyone !

15:15.200 --> 15:19.160
I'm so tired...
But I need even more...

15:20.160 --> 15:23.280
Attention...
More attention...

15:35.760 --> 15:36.920
Kirie !

15:39.800 --> 15:40.920
Shuichi...

15:41.240 --> 15:44.000
This is bad !
Katayama and Tsumura got loose !

15:44.400 --> 15:47.960
If we don't find them and get rid
of them quickly, they'll cause a panic.

16:08.360 --> 16:12.240
Mr. Yokota !
Please don't kill them !

16:16.080 --> 16:18.040
These are eggs
they laid after they mated !

16:19.720 --> 16:22.000
What ? Mated ?
But they're both male !

16:22.600 --> 16:25.120
Snails are neither male nor female,
they're hermaphroditic.

16:25.560 --> 16:28.760
If any of these things hatch,
it'll send the town into pandemonium.

16:30.720 --> 16:33.080
No, please don't !
Don't smash their eggs !

16:33.240 --> 16:35.360
There's no choice !
They aren't human anymore !

16:35.640 --> 16:37.960
They're called homo gastropoda,
snail people !

16:38.600 --> 16:41.760
- This is crazy...
- Wait ! Kazunori...

16:42.960 --> 16:44.880
Where are you going ?
You're in bad shape...

16:45.320 --> 16:48.120
The station ! Kazunori
and Yoriko are running away !

16:48.680 --> 16:50.720
- They're running away now ?
- Yeah.

16:51.000 --> 16:55.120
They're getting out of this town.
I just want at least them to escape.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.640
Running away together
is the smart decision,

17:06.000 --> 17:07.280
but are you sure they're coming ?

17:07.720 --> 17:11.120
They should be here any minute. He
said they were taking the 6:30 train.

17:14.200 --> 17:16.000
What is it ?
What are you running from ?

17:16.560 --> 17:18.600
We were spotted
sneaking out of the house.

17:19.080 --> 17:22.360
Our fathers are chasing after us !
They're staking out the station !

17:23.560 --> 17:25.880
- What can we do ?
- Let's cut through the beach !

17:26.240 --> 17:28.360
- We'll help you !
- Thank you so much, Shuichi !

17:32.160 --> 17:33.240
There they are !

17:33.320 --> 17:34.400
This way !

17:41.160 --> 17:45.000
Kazunori ! Stop this nonsense at once !
We're going home, now !

17:45.560 --> 17:47.200
No, Dad ! Get out of our way !

17:48.560 --> 17:49.840
I see them over there !

17:50.720 --> 17:52.000
Kazunori ! Run for it !

17:53.120 --> 17:55.160
Come back here ! Kazunori !

17:56.640 --> 17:57.800
Stop right there !

17:58.360 --> 18:00.360
I can't run... any further !

18:04.160 --> 18:05.280
Yoriko...

18:05.440 --> 18:06.640
You little twerp !

18:06.720 --> 18:09.320
How many times is it gonna take
to beat some sense into you ?!

18:14.160 --> 18:18.160
Kazunori... We're going to be
pulled apart again, aren't we ?

18:20.320 --> 18:23.200
Not again.
We're never going to be separated.

18:24.720 --> 18:27.760
We'll twist together !
Just like this !

18:44.040 --> 18:45.120
Yoriko !

18:51.080 --> 18:54.880
- Yoriko ! Your hand !
- Kazunori !

19:17.120 --> 19:18.680
What the heck is going on ?

19:19.160 --> 19:21.240
Yoriko !
Hang on, I'll get you out !

19:22.480 --> 19:25.000
Too tight !
It's as tight as a steel cable !

19:28.000 --> 19:29.960
Stop it, dad. Leave us alone.

19:30.800 --> 19:33.440
You can't break our love.
We'll never be apart again.

19:33.880 --> 19:36.160
Together. Forever.

20:12.200 --> 20:14.400
Excuse me,
is everything okay, ma'am ?

20:15.360 --> 20:18.440
What makes you think it's not ?
I'm on my way home.

20:18.680 --> 20:21.400
Funny thing is...
I keep walking and walking,

20:21.560 --> 20:23.640
but I don't seem
to be getting any closer.

20:37.480 --> 20:40.600
Someone, do something !
I can't walk in a straight line !

20:52.000 --> 20:55.040
Did you hear that the black lighthouse
suddenly lit up last night ?

20:55.360 --> 20:57.400
But hasn't it been broken
for several years ?

20:57.760 --> 20:59.160
I wonder when they fixed it.

20:59.640 --> 21:02.720
I heard a rumor that if you look into
the light it'll make you go insane !

21:03.080 --> 21:04.920
Really ? So creepy !

21:21.760 --> 21:22.920
Mr. Yokota !

21:25.040 --> 21:28.000
I can't believe
he turned into a snail person too...

21:30.040 --> 21:32.400
Sis, there you are !
Ya gotta come quick !

21:32.680 --> 21:34.040
What is it now, Mitsuo ?

21:38.320 --> 21:40.360
Must've run aground
sometime last night.

21:40.680 --> 21:43.720
But the seas were so calm.
And the lighthouse was operating.

21:44.320 --> 21:46.560
The way I hear it,
after it ran aground,

21:46.640 --> 21:49.560
her three crewmen were aimlessly
walking in circles up on the deck.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.200
Then they fell into the water.

21:51.600 --> 21:54.640
They managed to rescue one,
but the other crew are still missing.

21:54.920 --> 21:56.160
Speaking of missing,

21:56.240 --> 21:59.480
City Hall sent five experts to check
out the lighthouse last night.

22:00.000 --> 22:01.960
And yet no one's heard
from them since.

22:04.560 --> 22:05.680
Mitsuo ?

22:12.480 --> 22:13.760
Mitsuo !

22:21.800 --> 22:25.280
Mitsuo !
Get down here right now !

22:25.800 --> 22:29.440
- These stairs are so cool !
- Let's go up even higher, Mitsuo !

22:29.760 --> 22:30.840
Yeah !

22:31.440 --> 22:32.960
I guess I gotta go up...

22:47.160 --> 22:49.320
This doesn't make
any sense at all.

22:49.720 --> 22:52.000
I keep climbing
but never reach the top.

22:52.720 --> 22:55.880
It's as if I'm going around and
around in a never-ending circle.

22:58.000 --> 23:00.680
And that smell.
Like there's something burning...

23:01.360 --> 23:03.720
My head is starting to feel
so weird.

23:10.960 --> 23:12.080
Help us !

23:12.960 --> 23:14.000
Mitsuo !

23:20.240 --> 23:24.000
Mitsuo and his friend kept going.
They wanted to explore some more.

23:24.240 --> 23:26.400
I'll get them, you two
start heading back now.

23:26.760 --> 23:29.760
- Okay.
- Go quickly and don't stop !

23:42.120 --> 23:46.600
Sis, we can't move...
The spiral is staring at us !

23:47.360 --> 23:49.160
This is the lighthouse's lens.

23:50.360 --> 23:53.680
A Fresnel lens normally
is made up of concentric circles.

23:54.360 --> 23:57.000
Although... I wonder what happened
to make it look like that.

23:57.880 --> 24:00.680
It's like the whole thing
is warped and distorted.

24:02.160 --> 24:03.680
And those bodies...

24:05.040 --> 24:06.200
Oh, no !

24:12.360 --> 24:14.440
The both of you need
to start going down ! Now !

24:14.680 --> 24:16.680
The lighthouse's beam
turns on at sundown !

24:16.960 --> 24:18.880
We have to get out of here
before it activates !

24:19.760 --> 24:20.920
What do you mean ?

24:21.000 --> 24:23.280
That light must be
so unbelievably hot...

24:23.840 --> 24:26.560
Hot enough to melt glass.
And hot enough to...

24:27.160 --> 24:29.000
Hurry !
You need to start going down !

24:31.960 --> 24:34.560
What's going on ?
What's gonna happen to us ?

24:34.760 --> 24:36.600
I'll explain later.
Just keep moving !

24:53.320 --> 24:55.360
It's coming...
The heat is coming !

24:55.840 --> 24:57.360
Don't stop ! Keep running !

25:00.800 --> 25:01.880
No !

25:09.960 --> 25:14.200
The beam of the lighthouse that
had awoken from its peaceful slumber

25:15.240 --> 25:19.400
spread out ever so slowly
washing over us,

25:19.920 --> 25:21.840
as the spiral swallowed us whole.

25:22.720 --> 25:25.720
Leaving our town
helpless to resist it.

25:33.880 --> 25:36.920
Subtitling:
FAST TITLES MEDIA
